// How much each kind of world news matters, 0 to 3. The rail beside the map shows the kinds at
// `rail_minimum` or above, and anything about the player's own country whatever its level;
// the reports screen shows everything. A kind not named here is 1. A mod that adds a kind of
// news names it here as well, or leaves it at 1.
